The FoxitSymbol.cff and FoxitDingbats.cff files in this directory are the bare CFF font
programs extracted from PDFium's core/fxge/fontdata/chromefontdata source files, where they
are held as the kFoxitSymbolFontData and kFoxitDingbatsFontData byte arrays.

